<td id="S4.T1.2.4.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">(Canada: maplewood), (Bangladesh: shikha), (Japan: sakura),</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.5" class="ltx_tr">
<td id="S4.T1.2.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">school called <em id="S4.T1.2.5.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">mask</em> elementary</td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.5.2" class="ltx_td"></td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">(Slovakia: hrdinova), (South Korea: hanbok)</td></tr>
