<td id="S4.T1.2.6.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">58</td>
<td id="S4.T1.2.6.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left">(America: baseball), (India: cricket), (Canada: hockey),</td></tr>
<tr id="S4.T1.2.7" class="ltx_tr">
