<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Complete Classifier Results</h2>

<figure id="A4.F3" class="ltx_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_figure">
<div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A4.F3.sf1" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14626v1/macro_f1_gpt_3-5_turbo_classifier_with_nationality_template_with_nationality.svg" id="A4.F3.sf1.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/340;" width="476" height="340"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(a) </span>GPT 3.5 Turbo</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A4.F3.sf2" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14626v1/macro_f1_llama_3-3_70b_instruct_classifier_with_nationality_template_with_nationality.svg" id="A4.F3.sf2.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/340;" width="476" height="340"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(b) </span>Llama 3.3 70B Instruct</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A4.F3.sf3" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14626v1/macro_f1_llama_3-3_70b_instruct_classifier_with_nationality_template_with_nationality.svg" id="A4.F3.sf3.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/340;" width="476" height="340"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(c) </span>Gemma 3 12B Instruct</figcaption>
</figure></div><div class="ltx_flex_break"></div><div class="ltx_flex_cell ltx_flex_size_1">
<figure id="A4.F3.sf4" class="ltx_figure ltx_figure_panel ltx_align_center"><object type="image/svg+xml" data="2606.14626v1/macro_f1_llama_3-1_8B_instruct_classifier_with_nationality_template_with_nationality.svg" id="A4.F3.sf4.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_img_landscape" style="aspect-ratio:476/340;" width="476" height="340"></object>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">(d) </span>Llama 3.1 8B Instruct</figcaption>
</figure></div></div>
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure">Figure 3: </span>Identifying Cultural markers. F<math id="A4.F3.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="{}_{\mbox{1}}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mrow></mrow><mtext>1</mtext></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{}_{\mbox{1}}</annotation></semantics></math> of nationality classifier as a function of number of masked words.</figcaption>
</figure>
<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A4.F3" title="Figure 3 ‣ Appendix D Complete Classifier Results ‣ Characterizing Cultural Localization in AI-Generated Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">3</span></a> shows the performance of the culture classifier for the remaining 4 LLMs. Similar to results described in § 5.1, for all LLMs, when the culturally associated vocabulary is masked the classifier performance drops sharply. The drop is much more uniform for random masking. For all models, the performance on the original stories is near perfect.</p>
</div>
</section>
