<div id="A6.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A6.p1.1" class="ltx_p">Tables 6 to 9 show the top 10 countries with highest stereotype precision and offensiveness for all models. We see patterns similar to those observed in regional results for GPT 4o Mini stories in § 5.3. Table <a href="#A6.T10" title="Table 10 ‣ Appendix F Complete Stereotyping Results ‣ Characterizing Cultural Localization in AI-Generated Stories" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">10</span></a> shows examples of stereotypical attributes found in the cultural markers, as calculated using the SeeGULL dataset.</p>
</div>
